{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/cercn/2026/0809/c91703a3194116/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.059032+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/cercn/2026/0809/c91703a3194116/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span>浙江大学环境与资源学院竭诚欢迎全国各高校优秀本科毕业生申请我院推荐免试硕士研究生和直接攻读博士研究生，本校和外校考生均需在该系统进行申请，具体如下：</span></p><p><span><strong>一、申请条件及材料要求</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>申请条件、报名程序等详见“浙江大学关于</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知”（链接见下方），直接申请攻读博士学位研究生（以下简称直博生）者，还需具有较高水平的英语能力：大学英语六级</span></span><span><span>460</span><span>分及以上，或</span></span><span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span></span><span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）合格，或英语专业八级合格（以上各类成绩有效期五年，考试时间在</span></span><span><span>2022</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>30</span><span>日及以后有效），或雅思</span></span><span><span>5.5</span><span>分及以上或新托福</span></span><span><span>80</span><span>分及以上（不认可</span></span><span><span>in home</span><span>成绩和拼分成绩，有效期参照证书有效期）。</span></span></p><p><span>推免通知链接如下：</span></p><p><span><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>申请材料</span></span></p><p><span>以下材料请按照顺序进行标号并合成一个压缩文件（不超过</span><span><span>10M</span><span>），以“姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span><span>附件”命名，在申请系统中上传。</span></span></p><p><span>（1）个人身份证</span><span><span>(</span><span>正反面</span></span><span><span>)</span><span>扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span>（2）个人陈述（</span><span><strong><span>含学业和职业发展规划、意向导师姓名</span></strong></span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科阶段成绩单和成绩排名证明（由教务部门盖章）。如已经取得推免资格，请同时上传推免资格证明（教育部门盖章的证明或公示名单截屏）；</span></p><p><span>（4）外语水平证明材料，包括国家英语四、六级、或托福、雅思成绩证明；</span></p><p><span>（5）获奖证书（按照重要性排序）；</span></p><p><span>（6）科研成果证明材料（专利证书、已发表论文首页或已接收论文首页）。</span></p><p><span>另，申请直博生者还须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见电子版（模板见附件</span><span><span>2,</span><span><span>专家签字后的扫描件或推荐书内有专家电子签名），</span><a href=\"mailto:发送到邮箱hzzs@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>发送到邮箱</span></a></span></span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:发送到邮箱hzzs@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>hzzs@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span><span>，邮件主题命名为“</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年推免直博报名</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>报考专业</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>考生姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>专家推荐书”。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名截止时间：</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span><span>日</span></span><span>24:00</span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/cercn/2026/0809/c91703a3194116/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><strong>二、其他说明</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>本校学生需要在该系统申请报名，不单独开通申请通道。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>已参加我院全国优秀大学生学术夏令营并获得优秀营员的考生，也需要进入系统进行报名申请，填报信息时系统会自动调取报名夏令营时填写的信息，申请人可根据实际情况修改完善个人信息、报考信息等内容后提交。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>推荐免试研究生复试和录取具体工作安排另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>导师信息见学院网站：</span></span></p><p><span><span>http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/cercn/dsml/list.htm</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、重点提醒</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>申请人务必确保报名系统内邮箱、手机号码正确，并保持通讯畅通。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。若申请人弄虚作假、违反招生规定、存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消复试资格、录取资格、入学资格或学籍。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>我校拟录取的推免生应出色完成大学本科阶段的学业，并按期毕业，拟录取后如出现以下情形之一者，将被取消录取资格或入学资格：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）思想政治素质和品德考核不合格或政审不合格；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）从推免生报名至入学报到之日，受到任何处分；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）本科最后一学年计入毕业要求学分的相关课程成绩出现不及格记录；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）本科毕业设计（论文）成绩未达到良好及以上（或</span><span>80</span><span>分及以上）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）我校规定的研究生新生入学日期前无法提供毕业证书和学士学位证书。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>我校拟录取的推免生请于</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span><span>3</span><span>月自行到当地二甲及以上医院体检，并于</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span><span>3</span><span>月</span><span>31</span><span><span><span>日前</span><span><strong>将体检表寄送到我院研究生教育科。体检不合格者取消录取资格。</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>邮寄地址：浙江省杭州市西湖区余杭塘路</span><span><span>866</span><span>号浙江大学紫金港校区农生环大楼</span></span><span><span>B111</span><span>室，邮编：</span></span><span><span>310058</span><span>，收件人：宋老师，电话：</span></span><span><span>0571-88982448</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>附件：</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/856f371c40c6354d68c0.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/b5/02/7d1c7c0d41099446bcb96373e758/6e92df60-6be3-4ecd-b583-343f05a847d6.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1 系统申请填报步骤及常见问题说明.docx</a></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/856f371c40c6354d68c0.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/b5/02/7d1c7c0d41099446bcb96373e758/4d1134a3-0995-44ad-8e16-4b67c3d0d6f0.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2 浙江大学攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐信模板2026.docx</a></span></p><p><br/></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"72ca290f39aaada8a5909cf9cea521e856612111410655f1f2501db23b8d7c68","textLength":1559,"sourceSha256":"332546903198e0bb96b8739c7a1e978989f914899f8353ba89ecc184ea81e532","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-519b40ed6e74d6b2d015","title":"2026年浙江大学环境与资源学院关于接收2027年本校和外校推荐免试研究生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.059032+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/856f371c40c6354d68c0.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cers.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/856f371c40c6354d68c0.gif"}]}
